                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page3",
            "speaker": "celosia",
            "lines": [
                "You're here for answers, aren't you? I suppose we're at your mercy."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page4');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page4",
            "speaker": "celosia",
            "lines": [
                "I will tell you what I know, at least."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page5');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page5",
            "speaker": "bryony",
            "lines": [
                "We've been using the electricity we stole from the Power Plant to get everything prepared for activating the ultimate weapon."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page6');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page6",
            "speaker": "bryony",
            "lines": [
                "But it's not like that's all we'll need to use it."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page7');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page7",
            "speaker": "bryony",
            "lines": [
                "Are you following me? We'll need energy absorbed from Pokémon to power the device! Yes!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page8');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page8",
            "speaker": "bryony",
            "lines": [
                "It's the stones on Route 10 that will steal that energy for us and power the ultimate weapon!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page9');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page9",
            "speaker": "celosia",
            "lines": [
                "That's right. The stones on Route 10 normally put out energy, but when the ultimate weapon is activated,"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page10');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page10",
            "speaker": "celosia",
            "lines": [
                "that reverses and they begin to absorb energy from Pokémon!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page11');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page11",
            "speaker": "celosia",
            "lines": [
                "In reality, those stones that line Route 10 are the graves of Pokémon."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page12');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page12",
            "speaker": "celosia",
            "lines": [
                "When the ultimate weapon was used to end that horrible war over 3,000 years ago, it stole the lives of all those Pokémon."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page13');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page13",
            "speaker": "celosia",
            "lines": [
                "Their lives were the price of peace then."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page14');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page14",
            "speaker": "celosia",
            "lines": [
                "And if we want to make our own wishes come true today, we in Team Flare also have to sacrifice something precious."
            ],
